00:04:45.033 --> 00:04:47.767
-Uh...

00:04:47.767 --> 00:04:49.100
Starbucks?

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.701
-Nice.

00:04:51.501 --> 00:04:53.100
-Grande?
-Ooh.

00:04:55.067 --> 00:04:56.968
-I see how you got there.

00:04:59.634 --> 00:05:00.901
