-[ Gasps ]

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.467
-Starbucks and frozen.

00:05:07.467 --> 00:05:08.834
-Frappuccino?
-Oh!

00:05:08.834 --> 00:05:12.534
[ Dinging ]
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:12.534 --> 00:05:14.868
-Wow! Well, well.

00:05:17.133 --> 00:05:19.067
-Yes!

00:05:19.067 --> 00:05:22.634
Yabba-dabba-do!

00:05:22.634 --> 00:05:24.167
-Oh, my God.

00:05:24.167 --> 00:05:26.868
-Yabba-dabba-do!

00:05:26.868 --> 00:05:28.300
-Quest and Jimmy.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.901
-The password is...

00:05:31.767 --> 00:05:34.934
-Questlove, why don't you
start us off this time?

00:05:34.934 --> 00:05:36.767
-Okay. Okay.
-Got it?

00:05:42.467 --> 00:05:47.300
[ Laughter ]

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:49.200
-I'm going to
throw this away.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:50.567
I'm gonna throw this away.
-Alright.

00:05:50.567 --> 00:05:51.801
-And we'll get it
on the third one.

00:05:51.801 --> 00:05:53.367
-Good tactic.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:05:53.367 --> 00:05:55.100
