00:05:57.801 --> 00:05:59.334
[ Laughter ]

00:05:59.334 --> 00:06:00.901
Ants?
-Ants.

00:06:03.234 --> 00:06:04.234
-Ants.

00:06:04.234 --> 00:06:05.434
-First thing you think of ants.

00:06:05.434 --> 00:06:07.701
-Oh, anthill.

00:06:07.701 --> 00:06:09.100
-Oh, there we go.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.234
