00:07:32.367 --> 00:07:34.968
Oh, wow!
-Oh, my gosh!

00:07:34.968 --> 00:07:36.167
-Wow.
-Wowee.

00:07:36.167 --> 00:07:37.701
-You deserve that.
You deserve that.

00:07:37.701 --> 00:07:39.801
-Wow!
-You deserve that.

00:07:39.801 --> 00:07:41.033
